# Session memory (read before re-auditing)

Before re-researching AI calls, Train/FAQ, automations leftovers, WhatsApp connect, templates, billing, or “are we production-ready?”, read:

- `docs/memory/README.md`
- `docs/memory/STATUS_AND_FUTURE.md`
