**Do not redo** work listed there. **Do not** start Phase C automations, live WebRTC transfer, or billing implementation unless the user explicitly asks. Billing pointer: `.cursor/rules/billing-research.mdc` → `docs/billing/` (TARGET spec) vs `docs/audit/BILLING_SYSTEM_REVIEW.md` (current code).

**Status:** internal testing deploy of this build = yes (`bash start.sh`). Customer production / production-ready pipeline = **no**.

**Speech:** Sarvam STT/TTS + `sarvam-105b-conversations` on calls. Azure embeddings only. One AiBot for chat and voice.

**Public webhook health** returns counters + `webhookConfigured` only — no `webhookUrl`, no `lastError`, no Facebook trace. Use `META_WEBHOOK_URL` in `server/.env`. Settings App ID/Secret stay out of the UI.
